==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":82,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:07Z","updated_at":"2018-07-29T21:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2014-05-25T09:36:42Z","updated_at":"2014-08-30T08:33:24Z","closed_at":"2014-06-11T20:57:48Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"There seems to be an inconsistency between orientate3 vs. orientate4 (eulers_angles.inl). Note that the parameters of yawPitchRoll is different. I believe the orientate4 is the correct order.\n\n```\ntemplate <typename T, precision P>\nGLM_FUNC_QUALIFIER detail::tmat3x3<T, P> orientate3\n(\n    detail::tvec3<T, P> const & angles\n)\n{\n    return detail::tmat3x3<T, P>(yawPitchRoll(angles.x, angles.y, angles.z));\n}\n\ntemplate <typename T, precision P>\nGLM_FUNC_QUALIFIER detail::tmat4x4<T, P> orientate4\n(\n    detail::tvec3<T, P> const & angles\n)\n{\n    return yawPitchRoll(angles.z, angles.x, angles.y);\n}\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/207/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}